BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 466.583 Td (1. Print and check the 3 cm calibration square before cutting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 443.906 Td (2. This block uses standard assumptions for shoulder slope, underbust  sew a quick muslin \(test version\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 428.031 Td (from cheap fabric first and adjust before cutting your real fabric.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 405.354 Td (3. Cut every piece as labelled: pieces marked 'on fold' on the fabric fold, 'cut 2' twice.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 382.677 Td (4. Fuse interfacing to the neck facings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 360.000 Td (5. Staystitch the neckline just inside the seam line so it doesn't stretch while you work.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 337.323 Td (6. Staystitch the curved princess edges too, for the same reason.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 314.646 Td (7. Sew each bodice princess seam: pin center panel to side panel matching the bust notch, sew, clip the side) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 298.772 Td (panel's curve over the bust inside the seam allowance, press toward the center.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 276.094 Td (8. Sew the remaining waist darts \(where a panel wasn't split\), pressing toward the center.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 253.417 Td (9. Sew the bodice shoulder seams and press them open.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 230.740 Td (10. Sew the front and back neck facings together at the shoulders; finish the facing's outer edge \(zigzag,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 214.866 Td (overlock or turn 5 mm and stitch\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 192.189 Td (11. Attach the facing to the neckline right sides together, leaving the last 2 cm free at each center back edge) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 176.315 Td (\(the zipper goes there later\). Trim to 6 mm, clip into the curve every 2 cm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 153.638 Td (12. Understitch: press the seam allowance toward the facing and stitch it to the facing 2 mm from the seam ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 137.764 Td (this keeps the facing rolled inside. Turn, press, tack at the shoulder seams.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 115.087 Td (13. Sew the bodice side seams.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 92.409 Td (14. Finish armholes with bias binding \(sleeveless\).) Tj ET

